  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "V52: Remove duplicate entries in short info element value_string",
  "description": "Summary:\n\nIn info_element_values_short, duplicate values VARIANT (0x22) and INTERFACE_ID (0x23) were present alongside ENABLE_METERING (0x22) and METERING_REPORT (0x23). Since this array is initialized with VALUE_STRING_EXT_INIT, duplicate keys break the binary search lookups used by val_to_str_ext_const().\n\nChanges:\n\n\\- Removed duplicate entries VARIANT and INTERFACE_ID to match info_element_values.\n\n\\- Verified with tools/check_val_to_str.py (0 warnings).",
  "state": "merged",
