      "title": "V52: Remove duplicate entries in short info element value_string",
      "message": "V52: Remove duplicate entries in short info element value_string\n\nIn info_element_values_short, VARIANT (0x22) and INTERFACE_ID (0x23) were included alongside ENABLE_METERING (0x22) and METERING_REPORT (0x23). Because this array is wrapped with VALUE_STRING_EXT_INIT, duplicate keys break binary search lookups in val_to_str_ext_const().\n\nRemove the duplicate entries to align with info_element_values.",
